      939   PROCEDURE adm-assign-record :
      940    MESSAGE
      941          "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
      942            "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Assign.":U
      943              VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
      944      RETURN.
      945     END PROCEDURE.
